sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant MW as Middleware
  participant SA as Server action
  participant CTX as Action context
  participant ST as Domain store
  participant DB as D1
  B->>MW: POST (server action)
  MW->>MW: session check, audience rules
  MW->>SA: request
  SA->>SA: parse input (zod)
  SA->>CTX: projectContext(id, options)
  CTX->>DB: user, memberships, overrides (one batch, cached)
  CTX->>CTX: demo check, canFeature
  CTX->>DB: project in scope?
  CTX-->>SA: context or ActionFailure
  SA->>ST: domain operation (rules.ts math)
  ST->>DB: db.batch(writes + audit)
  ST-->>SA: result
  SA->>SA: revalidatePath
  SA-->>B: success or error
